      "text": "User\n- id\n- name\n- lastOnline\n\n\nGroup\n- id\n- name\n\nGroupParticipants\n- userId\n- groupId\n\nGive me all the groups of userId\nGive me all the users of given groupId\nPrimary key: <userId>\nSecondary Key: <groupId>\n\n\nMesssages\n- groupId\n- messageId\n- senderId\n- createdAt\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User\n- id\n- name\n- lastOnline\n\n\nGroup\n- id\n- name\n\nGroupParticipants\n- userId\n- groupId\n\nGive me all the groups of userId\nGive me all the users of given groupId\nPrimary key: <userId>\nSecondary Key: <groupId>\n\n\nMesssages\n- groupId\n- messageId\n- senderId\n- createdAt\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
