      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771839181030,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Roles: [\"admin\", \"user\"]\n- Permissions: [\"write\", \"read\", \"delete\"]\n\n\nUser\n- id\n- name\n- admin\n\nRole\n- id\n- name\n\nPermissions\n- p_id\n- name\n\nRole_Permission\n\"RoleId\": id\n\"PErmissionId\" : p_id",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Roles: [\"admin\", \"user\"]\n- Permissions: [\"write\", \"read\", \"delete\"]\n\n\nUser\n- id\n- name\n- admin\n\nRole\n- id\n- name\n\nPermissions\n- p_id\n- name\n\nRole_Permission\n\"RoleId\": id\n\"PErmissionId\" : p_id",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vcYHbwV28E_Wa85Lq-tWT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2598.4999943020175,
      "y": 12088.450654663091,
      "width": 1122,
      "height": 700,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 14006834,
      "version": 1297,
      "versionNonce": 1001089906,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771919916951,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirements\n- There are agents (ChatGPT, Cursor)\n- There will be MCP tools (Python standalone server)\n- Process (Agents and tools combinations)\n- Portal: Build their agents, tools and processes\n- Banking Portal, they can use it for Loan processing agent, KYC..\n- Bank employee, some changes to Loan processing agent (750 civil score, discount to 8%)\n- In general, contact developers\n- Low or No code Portal (Prompt)\n- Test the changes in an isolated environment\n- Isolate it and test it\n- Get it reviewed\n- YML, JSON file\n\n\n- JSON or YML file will be present somewhere on the cloud (Github)\n- TAke a pull of latest code\n- Visual studio/ Cursor\n- Github copilot\n- credit score\n    - score: >=750\n    - interest rate: 10%\n- Prompt: Make changes in the loan config file for user who are having credit score greater than 750, \nmake interest to 8%\n- List of users, metadata, civil score\n- GIven a list of users, please test if for users having credit score > 750, \nwhat is the interest rate being applied?\n- Write a script",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirements\n- There are agents (ChatGPT, Cursor)\n- There will be MCP tools (Python standalone server)\n- Process (Agents and tools combinations)\n- Portal: Build their agents, tools and processes\n- Banking Portal, they can use it for Loan processing agent, KYC..\n- Bank employee, some changes to Loan processing agent (750 civil score, discount to 8%)\n- In general, contact developers\n- Low or No code Portal (Prompt)\n- Test the changes in an isolated environment\n- Isolate it and test it\n- Get it reviewed\n- YML, JSON file\n\n\n- JSON or YML file will be present somewhere on the cloud (Github)\n- TAke a pull of latest code\n- Visual studio/ Cursor\n- Github copilot\n- credit score\n    - score: >=750\n    - interest rate: 10%\n- Prompt: Make changes in the loan config file for user who are having credit score greater than 750, \nmake interest to 8%\n- List of users, metadata, civil score\n- GIven a list of users, please test if for users having credit score > 750, \nwhat is the interest rate being applied?\n- Write a script",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cMUxDt0LOWioRnQlzpOYA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2878.3298809316125,
      "y": 12902.145405952066,
      "width": 594,
      "height": 1000,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 93770367,
      "version": 481,
      "versionNonce": 1995849455,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772282647252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design a Loan Disbursement & Repayment System that: \n\nCreates loans\nDisburses money\nTracks EMIs\nHandles repayment events\nReconciles failed payments\n\n\nEntities\n\n---\nUser\n    - name\n    - email\n    - creditScore\n\nLoan\n   - userId \n   - loanAmount\n   - tenure\n   - interestRate\n   - startingDate\n   - endingDate\n   - disbursmentStatus\n\nEMIs\n    - emiAmount\n    - paymentDate\n    - paymentMethod\n    - emiNumber\n    - loanId\n    - paymentStatus\n\nLedger (Append only file keeping all the transactions)\nPayment Gateway \n\n \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design a Loan Disbursement & Repayment System that: \n\nCreates loans\nDisburses money\nTracks EMIs\nHandles repayment events\nReconciles failed payments\n\n\nEntities\n\n---\nUser\n    - name\n    - email\n    - creditScore\n\nLoan\n   - userId \n   - loanAmount\n   - tenure\n   - interestRate\n   - startingDate\n   - endingDate\n   - disbursmentStatus\n\nEMIs\n    - emiAmount\n    - paymentDate\n    - paymentMethod\n    - emiNumber\n    - loanId\n    - paymentStatus\n\nLedger (Append only file keeping all the transactions)\nPayment Gateway \n\n \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "f5KF5_FKOAxsU3fmtTtlZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2678.3738554758065,
      "y": 13898.867298388179,
      "width": 583,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 852044021,
      "version": 643,
      "versionNonce": 732249149,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773766632330,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "APIs\n\nPOST /loans -> Loan\n\nPOST /loans/:loanId/payment/emis\n    - amount\n   - It will call RazorPay API (Make Payment)\n        - API key in headers\n        - Response: Payment Link (TTL)\n\nLoan Disbursment Engine (Accepted)\n- USer account number\n- bank number\n- IFSC code\n\n- MAke Payment from Platform account to USers Account\n- Platform API\n    - PG API (unique transction identifier)\n- Retry\n    - PG API (unique identifier)\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "APIs\n\nPOST /loans -> Loan\n\nPOST /loans/:loanId/payment/emis\n    - amount\n   - It will call RazorPay API (Make Payment)\n        - API key in headers\n        - Response: Payment Link (TTL)\n\nLoan Disbursment Engine (Accepted)\n- USer account number\n- bank number\n- IFSC code\n\n- MAke Payment from Platform account to USers Account\n- Platform API\n    - PG API (unique transction identifier)\n- Retry\n    - PG API (unique identifier)\n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
