      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774844154520,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Receives a File\n- Stores metadata related to a file in DB\n- Push the file to S3, so that even if processing\n fails for file, it doesn't need to ask the bank\n\n- Before uploading, we can calculate the checksum of file\n- if it is already there, avoid uploading the file again to s3",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Receives a File\n- Stores metadata related to a file in DB\n- Push the file to S3, so that even if processing\n fails for file, it doesn't need to ask the bank\n\n- Before uploading, we can calculate the checksum of file\n- if it is already there, avoid uploading the file again to s3",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
