      "seed": 1068470261,
      "version": 414,
      "versionNonce": 1781892853,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774860073017,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Logging System (Kibana)\n\nFunctional Requirements\n- Ingest logs from multiple services\n- Supports structured and unstructured logs\n- Real time & batch ingestion\n- Full text search\n- Filtering (time range, service, severity)\n- Alerting on patterns (errors spike etc)\n\n\nNon functional\n- High throughput\n- Low latency search (< 1-2s)\n- Fault tolerant (logs are critical for debugging)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Logging System (Kibana)\n\nFunctional Requirements\n- Ingest logs from multiple services\n- Supports structured and unstructured logs\n- Real time & batch ingestion\n- Full text search\n- Filtering (time range, service, severity)\n- Alerting on patterns (errors spike etc)\n\n\nNon functional\n- High throughput\n- Low latency search (< 1-2s)\n- Fault tolerant (logs are critical for debugging)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
