    {
      "id": "miTeyLC7Kh89gKc3CdDY1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2562.8494082141447,
      "y": 19591.472775512808,
      "width": 858,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1135062846,
      "version": 838,
      "versionNonce": 1301952638,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775058485800,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Questions\n- How do we pull these recording from these systems?\n- When do we pull?\n- Do these systems have limitations on how and when to pull?\n- Authentication between Recordings ingestor and these systems\n- Scaling part of our ingestor\n- What happens if we fail to pull?\n- Data size of each recordings\n- Recording (Data type)? \n\n- What happens after we take data from sources? What are the things we do?\n- What do we send in the queue?\n- Scaling part of queue?\n- What happens if ingestor is producing more than consumer is able to process?\n- Partition key?\n- Hot key?\n- Partition replication\n\n\n- Processor does what with the data?\n- Where and how does it store?\n- Scaling of Recording Processor?\n- Data sources?\n- Idempotency?\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Questions\n- How do we pull these recording from these systems?\n- When do we pull?\n- Do these systems have limitations on how and when to pull?\n- Authentication between Recordings ingestor and these systems\n- Scaling part of our ingestor\n- What happens if we fail to pull?\n- Data size of each recordings\n- Recording (Data type)? \n\n- What happens after we take data from sources? What are the things we do?\n- What do we send in the queue?\n- Scaling part of queue?\n- What happens if ingestor is producing more than consumer is able to process?\n- Partition key?\n- Hot key?\n- Partition replication\n\n\n- Processor does what with the data?\n- Where and how does it store?\n- Scaling of Recording Processor?\n- Data sources?\n- Idempotency?\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LQ0cMTwiWLl9OqQTSoq3I",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2039.7291980976497,
      "y": 20269.715355896213,
      "width": 1034,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1281442302,
      "version": 699,
      "versionNonce": 256464994,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775103843429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Zoom\n- It relies on Zooms Native APIs and webhooks to retrieve files after meeting concludes\n- Zoom App MarketPlace\n    - Create App\n    - Copy the Secret Key\n    - Provide the URL (Where zoom will send the data)\n    - Also subscribe to events\n\n- RingCentral (Admin Side)\n    - Admin Settings > Integrations > Catalog\n    - Selects Zoom\n    - By clicking \"enable\", they activate the specific listener endpoint\n    - User Mappings (Admin must ensure, mail of the user in both accounts are same)\n    - CRM Linking (This is usually where the Admin connect AI pipeline to CRMs).\n        - They define the rules where final AI summary is sent after Zoom calls are processed.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Zoom\n- It relies on Zooms Native APIs and webhooks to retrieve files after meeting concludes\n- Zoom App MarketPlace\n    - Create App\n    - Copy the Secret Key\n    - Provide the URL (Where zoom will send the data)\n    - Also subscribe to events\n\n- RingCentral (Admin Side)\n    - Admin Settings > Integrations > Catalog\n    - Selects Zoom\n    - By clicking \"enable\", they activate the specific listener endpoint\n    - User Mappings (Admin must ensure, mail of the user in both accounts are same)\n    - CRM Linking (This is usually where the Admin connect AI pipeline to CRMs).\n        - They define the rules where final AI summary is sent after Zoom calls are processed.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
