      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775138507442,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Look for websocket connection in its map\n2. Send the notification making use of the websocket connection\n\n\nWhen users will come online, they they will try to fetch all th\nnotifications which are in \"PENDING\" state.\nAnd once delivered, will mark them delivered.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Look for websocket connection in its map\n2. Send the notification making use of the websocket connection\n\n\nWhen users will come online, they they will try to fetch all th\nnotifications which are in \"PENDING\" state.\nAnd once delivered, will mark them delivered.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
