    {
      "id": "O0ZjvRs0kZzPvHWAUmzt7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3048.389143190977,
      "y": 23667.421987102352,
      "width": 1485,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 860957260,
      "version": 87,
      "versionNonce": 646486604,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775146764156,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Authorization: Bearer <header>.<payload>.<signature>\n\nService B takes the header and the payload from the token and runs them through a hashing algorithm (like RS256) using that Public Key.\nIf the result matches the signature sent in the token, the \"seal\" is authentic.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Authorization: Bearer <header>.<payload>.<signature>\n\nService B takes the header and the payload from the token and runs them through a hashing algorithm (like RS256) using that Public Key.\nIf the result matches the signature sent in the token, the \"seal\" is authentic.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
