      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1775899295595,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Questions\n- How does API gateway looks like in code?\n- Prepare around how database looked like with all columns and tables\n- Talk about Agent assignment (User preferences etc)\n- Redis keys\n- See how queue comes in the picture (If all agents are busy)\n- See Redis Pub Sub thing as well (Topic, events) etc\n_ Redis sharding",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Questions\n- How does API gateway looks like in code?\n- Prepare around how database looked like with all columns and tables\n- Talk about Agent assignment (User preferences etc)\n- Redis keys\n- See how queue comes in the picture (If all agents are busy)\n- See Redis Pub Sub thing as well (Topic, events) etc\n_ Redis sharding",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
