    {
      "id": "pAxVndkNaPHjG8Lc4WAtJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2474.962951698666,
      "y": 27719.681214771437,
      "width": 1643.399169921875,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1678500294,
      "version": 391,
      "versionNonce": 604032902,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1775899301212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Chat Server makes a request to Routing Engine for agent assignment\n2. Routing agent checks for agents having least current chat connection from Redis \n3. Respectively return the agent_id to Chat Server",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Chat Server makes a request to Routing Engine for agent assignment\n2. Routing agent checks for agents having least current chat connection from Redis \n3. Respectively return the agent_id to Chat Server",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QmW5EKo9CBgDXOYJ07zHQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1198.4731709272423,
      "y": 27902.60286623348,
      "width": 1524.599365234375,
      "height": 855,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1110869894,
      "version": 457,
      "versionNonce": 1535700678,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775899301212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Redis\n\nagent:{agent_id} (HSET)\n- name\n- language\n- ..other metadata\n\navailable_agents:{language} (ZADD)\nmember: agent_id\nscore: current_chat_count\n\nchat:{chat_id} (HSET)\nchat:{chat_id}:message:{message_id} (HSET)\n\nWhen customer starts a chat, but no agent is free, we maintain queue in redis\n\nchat:queue:{language}\nmember: customer_id\nscore: timestamp",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Redis\n\nagent:{agent_id} (HSET)\n- name\n- language\n- ..other metadata\n\navailable_agents:{language} (ZADD)\nmember: agent_id\nscore: current_chat_count\n\nchat:{chat_id} (HSET)\nchat:{chat_id}:message:{message_id} (HSET)\n\nWhen customer starts a chat, but no agent is free, we maintain queue in redis\n\nchat:queue:{language}\nmember: customer_id\nscore: timestamp",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
