    {
      "id": "epQFIYExVKi84CNDaZffo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3791.849166420623,
      "y": 28658.100484573046,
      "width": 1168.19921875,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 192976154,
      "version": 259,
      "versionNonce": 1245268166,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1775899301212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Workers pull the chat_id from SQS\n2. Do the processing of moving data from redis to MongoDB\n3. Generate the transcripts\n4. If something wrong happens with processing of chat, that\nchat is moved to DLQ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Workers pull the chat_id from SQS\n2. Do the processing of moving data from redis to MongoDB\n3. Generate the transcripts\n4. If something wrong happens with processing of chat, that\nchat is moved to DLQ",
